                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U \coloneqq \underset{i \in I}{\sqcup} U_i
                      of the patches as the object
                      = succeed "," do
                        %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                          %semantics
                            %mrow
                              %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
