                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{g_'_{i',j'} \colon U'_{i'} \cap U'_{j'} \to GL(n',k) \}_{i', j'}
                  the corrsponding component functions.
            %p
              Then a
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coboundary"} coboundary
              between these two cocycles is
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  the condition that
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi n
                          %mo =
                          %mi n
